Output docs/assets/clips/vault.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 440
Set Padding 12
Set Framerate 12
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set CursorBlink false

Hide
Type `exec "$KDEMO_DIR/env.sh" zsh`
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "cd ~/code/api && clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Sleep 800ms
Type "notes-vault-mcp context"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Ctrl+L
Type `notes-vault-mcp search "why do totals drift by a cent"`
Enter
Sleep 6s
Ctrl+L
Type "notes-vault-mcp read Resources/line-rounding-trap.md"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Ctrl+L
Type "notes-vault-mcp backlog"
Enter
Sleep 5s
